[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>Raise the lift.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p>1. Undo the plug and drain the engine oil into a suitable container.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Used engine oil contains substances\nharmful to the environment. It is absolutely forbidden to dispose\nof waste oil in the environment. Deposit these substances in appropriate\ncollection containers.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2020891.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on the ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p>1. Undo the engine oil drain plug and drain the oil.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Collect the engine oil in a suitable\ncontainer.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021104.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the car on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p>1. Undo the engine oil drain plug and drain the oil into a suitable\ncontainer.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Do not disperse the oil into the\nenvironment, as indiscriminate dispersal of this product causes pollution.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065646.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p>Position a suitable container for collecting\nthe oil under the oil sump.</p><p>1. Undo the drain plug and collect the oil in the container.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Used engine oil contains substances\nharmful to the environment. Discard  these substances in containers\ndesigned for their disposal.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021350.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the engine oil drain plug and drain the oil.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Recover the engine oil in a suitable\ncontainer.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021600.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Tighten the engine oil plug to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Plug</p></td><td><p>ENGINE OIL DRAIN PLUG</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Lower the lift.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584120\">0010T11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p>Remove the car from the lift.</p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit a new engine oil drain plug complete\nwith seal and tighten it to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Plug</p></td><td><p>ENGINE OIL DRAIN PLUG</p></td><td><p>M22</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>5</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584119\">0010T10</a></p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Tighten the new engine oil drain plug to\nthe recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>ENGINE OIL DRAIN PLUG</p></td><td><p>M14</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Crankcase sump side) 1.8 ÷ 2.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Refill the engine oil lubrication system \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2584120\">0010T11</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the drain plug in the threaded seat\nin the sump and tighten it to torque.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Replace the oil plug copper gasket.</p></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Plug</p></td><td><p>ENGINE OIL DRAIN PLUG</p></td><td><p>M18 x 1.5</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2584120\">0010T11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit a new engine oil drain plug complete\nwith seal and tighten it to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>ENGINE OIL DRAIN PLUG</p></td><td><p>M18</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Crankcase sump side) 1.8 ÷ 2.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Refill the engine oil lubrication system \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2584121\">0010T12</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramp.</p>"]]